 data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2345]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2346]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>T</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>FT\u2019S</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> in Pts with symptoms.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2347]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>B</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>asal body </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>temperature</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u>NR.</u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2348]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Endometrial biopsy</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> NR.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2349]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No role of treatment of luteal phase defect.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2350]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Testing</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> for viral Statu</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>s:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2351]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>HCP B, C &amp; </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>HIV</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2352]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2353]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Man HiV positive:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2354]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Minimal risk of transmission.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2355]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No sperm washing. </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2356]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>pre \u2013 </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>expos</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ur</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>e prophylaxis.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2357]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2358]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>                                  </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>If:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2359]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>M</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>a</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>n</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> on HAART.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2360]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Viral load &lt;50 copies in 6months</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2361]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No co-infection.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2362]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Unprotected sex limited to ovulation time.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2363]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2364]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If above criteria not met, then sperm washing is required as well as pre \u2013 expos</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ur</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>e prophylaxis.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2365]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>HeP B Positive</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 vaccination to partner.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2366]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>HeP E Positive</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 Discussion with specialist to eradicate </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>the disease</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2367]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Rubella Testing </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2368]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Offer testing</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2369]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>susceptible =&gt; offer vaccination.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2370]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>C</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>ervical</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> Screening:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2371]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Screening for </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>chlamydia</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2372]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Done</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 positive \u2013 treatment + contact tracing of both </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>partners</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2373]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Not done</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 A/B prophylaxis.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2374]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Offer screening before IUI.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2375]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2376]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Unexplained Infertility:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2377]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>IVF after 2 years, including 1 year before work up.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2378]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Don\u2019t offer ovulation induction</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2379]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2380]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2381]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2382]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2383]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2384]\">\u00a0</p>",
